{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01666","headline":"杂曲歌辞 结客少年场行 · 李白","name":"杂曲歌辞 结客少年场行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"紫燕黄金瞳，啾啾摇绿鬉。\n平明相驰逐，结客洛门东。\n少年学劒术，凌轹白猨公。\n珠袍曳锦带，七首插吴鸿。\n由来万夫勇，挟此生雄风。\n托交从剧孟，买醉入新丰。\n笑尽一杯酒，杀人都市中。\n羞道易水寒，从令日贯虹。\n燕丹事不立，虚没秦帝宫。\n舞阳死灰人，安可与成功。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01666.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01666","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}